OL,3,GNEWSA'Serious failings' found in
OL,4,Acouncil social housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FInspectors have found "serious
OL,7,Ffailings" with a Surrey council's
OL,8,Fhousing services.
OL,10,FThe Regulator of Social Housing said
OL,11,F12% of Woking Borough Council's homes
OL,12,Fdid not meet the minimum quality and
OL,13,Fsafety requirements set out in the
OL,14,FDecent Homes Standard.
OL,16,FThere were "some weaknesses" related to
OL,17,Foverdue fire, water and asbestos
OL,18,Fremedial actions, it continued.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
