OL,3,GNEWSA'Serious failings' found in
OL,4,Acouncil social housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FWoking Borough Council - which owns and
OL,7,Fmanages 3,000 homes - said it accepted
OL,8,Fthe regulator's report and it was
OL,9,F"working tirelessly" to address the
OL,10,Fissues raised.
